# The installer is ~96 MB. It is attached to GitHub Releases rather than
# committed: git keeps every version forever, so committing it would add ~96 MB
# to the repo on every rebuild and would eventually break pushes (GitHub
# hard-rejects files over 100 MB).
# `npm run dist` still drops a copy here for local use.
Helldivers Macro Machine Setup.exe

# No longer produced - kept ignored so a stale copy can't be committed by mistake.
Helldivers Macro Machine.exe
